<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  The profile judge (Part of #6 and #15): daily at 06:10, before the 08:00 plan, judge up to 15 of the top 40 ranked
  companies whose judgment is missing or 14 days old: read each one's homepage, about page and best posting politely,
  ask Devanshu's Claude Code seat once per company what it builds and how well it fits him, check the answer in code
  and store it as an event. The 08:00 plan re-ranks, so the judgment adds its points there. One summary line per run
  in the log.

  Shipped off: while [judge] enabled is false in outreach/judge/config.toml the job prints "judge is off" and exits 0,
  with no fetch, no call and no write. The run command starts /usr/bin/caffeinate -i -w <its pid> when it is on, so
  the Mac stays awake until it ends. The claude CLI is found on PATH or at ~/.local/bin/claude.

  StartCalendarInterval (not StartInterval), so a run missed while the Mac sleeps fires on wake. A rerun is safe: a
  company judged inside the 14-day window is not due again.

  It follows the deploy tool's one convention (#17, outreach/deploy/jobs.py): WorkingDirectory is the live checkout,
  the program is the checkout's venv python run as a module, and both streams go to the log. Placeholders, filled by
  the deploy tool: {{LIVE_CHECKOUT}} is the live checkout, {{LOG_PATH}} the log file. Nothing else is filled; the
  store is the default.

  Not installed by the repo, and never loaded from a worktree. Installing it is Devanshu's step, through the deploy
  tool (python -m outreach.deploy plan, then install). To remove it:
    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.devanshu.outreach-judge
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.devanshu.outreach-judge</string>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>{{LIVE_CHECKOUT}}</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>{{LIVE_CHECKOUT}}/.venv/bin/python</string>
    <string>-m</string>
    <string>outreach.judge</string>
    <string>run</string>
  </array>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>6</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>10</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>{{LOG_PATH}}</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>{{LOG_PATH}}</string>
</dict>
</plist>
